  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIf you exit the Drone while having the flight presets open causes the preset buttons to appear on the normal camera.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Turn on the Drone\n\n2. Open the Flight Presets\n\n3. Close the drone (e.g. by pressing Escape)\n\n4. Open the normal Camera\n\nIf you do this you will notice the 4 flight presets still being visible.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe flight presets should not be visible in the normal camera.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a screenshot showcasing the issue:",
